WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:01.560
Your Highness

00:01.640 --> 00:02.480
General Zhu

00:02.600 --> 00:04.400
Has settled us all

00:04.520 --> 00:05.720
Some clans

00:05.800 --> 00:07.360
Unwilling to hand over command

00:07.440 --> 00:08.480
Those who stayed

00:08.560 --> 00:09.880
Are mostly veterans

00:09.960 --> 00:11.800
All fought over ten years ago

00:11.880 --> 00:13.880
In that defeat at Yong'an

00:14.320 --> 00:15.360
Back then

00:15.440 --> 00:17.040
We feared the Wunu

00:17.120 --> 00:18.920
And ran

00:19.400 --> 00:20.800
My wife

00:20.960 --> 00:22.040
And son

00:22.120 --> 00:24.480
All died under Wunu hooves

00:27.040 --> 00:28.440
This time

00:29.440 --> 00:31.760
We will definitely for Great Xuan

00:31.840 --> 00:33.400
Hold this city

00:42.320 --> 00:44.320
Then I'll trouble General Liu

00:51.000 --> 00:56.000
On the sixth day, the turmoil of the volunteer troops entering the city had subsided, and the garrison bustled with their respective duties. The Wunu sent out only small detachments to harass periodically, all of which were successfully repelled by the defenders.

00:57.000 --> 01:01.500
This seemed like the calm before the storm; no one knew what conspiracy Shi Lang was plotting once again.

01:55.040 --> 01:55.760
Liu Nian

01:55.840 --> 01:57.840
Pays respects to Your Highness

